From 0b67679fec6e92c3d29f0b21afcd2dd47cd4f6ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NEMO executor <executor@nemo.local>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:59:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] coag: Part B 1e figure -- data/plotting split

- coag_diffusion.py: 'figure-data' stage dumps the figure data as TSVs
  (figures/coag_diffusion_data/: panelA_nemo, panelA_analytic, panelB, meta)
  so the plot can be regenerated without re-running NEMO.
- scripts/plot_coag_diffusion.py: standalone plotter (no code units) consuming
  those TSVs -> figures/coag_diffusion.{png,pdf}. Editable in isolation.
- figure: left = additive over-diffusion into the large-mass tail shrinking from
  16 to 40 bins vs analytic (tau=0.5,1,2); right = L1 convergence vs bins, both
  kernels, ~slope-1 (k=0). Styling: two resolutions, coarse-grid bin-edge lines,
  tail clipped below ~1e-16 g/H.
---
 figures/coag_diffusion.pdf                    |  Bin 0 -> 31035 bytes
 figures/coag_diffusion.png                    |  Bin 0 -> 193689 bytes
 figures/coag_diffusion_data/meta.txt          |    4 +
 .../coag_diffusion_data/panelA_analytic.tsv   | 1501 +++++++++++++++++
 figures/coag_diffusion_data/panelA_nemo.tsv   |  169 ++
 figures/coag_diffusion_data/panelB.tsv        |    9 +
 scripts/coag_diffusion.py                     |   62 +-
 scripts/plot_coag_diffusion.py                |  138 ++
 8 files changed, 1882 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 figures/coag_diffusion.pdf
 create mode 100644 figures/coag_diffusion.png
 create mode 100644 figures/coag_diffusion_data/meta.txt
 create mode 100644 figures/coag_diffusion_data/panelA_analytic.tsv
 create mode 100644 figures/coag_diffusion_data/panelA_nemo.tsv
 create mode 100644 figures/coag_diffusion_data/panelB.tsv
 create mode 100644 scripts/plot_coag_diffusion.py

